== Section A — The subject, its tools and the earth in space (Questions 1–15)

#mcq(1, [The spatial perspective in geography is best illustrated by asking],
  [what a rock is made of],
  [how a machine works],
  [why a phenomenon occurs in one place rather than another],
  [when a war ended]
)

